# The Last Ronin: "I - Destroy all creatures. II - Mill four cards. When you do, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. III - Whenever a creature you
# control attacks alone this turn, put three +1/+1 counters on it. It gains trample, lifelink, and indestructible until end of turn." Turn 1: Bot1 casts Memnite and Ornithopter,
# then the Ronin with {4}{B}{G} from Black Lotus and three Moxen; chapter I destroys both. Turn 3: chapter II mills four Islands and returns Memnite (the Ornithopter is a legal
# target too, an Island is not); Bot1 recasts it. Turn 5: chapter III, and Memnite attacks alone: a 4/4 with trample, lifelink and indestructible, hitting for 4 (Bot2 on 16, Bot1 on 24).

